sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: SSE event dispatch, reconnection cursor and server replay
  accDescr: Blank-line termination dispatches event 7, incomplete EOF does not dispatch its tail, and a new request with Last-Event-ID 7 receives retained event 8 under this server contract.
participant C as Client parser
  participant S as Server
  C->>S: GET event stream
  S-->>C: id: 7 + data + blank line
  Note over C,S: Dispatch 7, cursor 7
  S-->>C: data: interrupted + EOF
  Note over C,S: No blank line: no tail event
  C->>S: New GET<br/>Last-Event-ID: 7
  S-->>C: Retained event 8 + blank line
  Note over C,S: Dispatch 8 in this example<br/>Replay needs server history
